00034  ; LIBRARY FILE CONSTANTS.65S
00035  ; version 2.30
00036  ; two pass symbolic assembler, dissembler and tracer
00037  ; REGB bits 0-3 are connected to LED's
00038  ; tested in Michael Kowalski 6502 Simulator - using 65C02 Code 
