00914  00E415  20 C1 FB      PRNTAX              JSR     WR2HEX              ;Print target adr of branch (DUPLICATE FUNCTION to WRWORDAY)
00915  00E418  8A            PRNTX               TXA                         ; *  and return
00916  00E419  4C C1 FB                          JMP     WR2HEX              
